---
import SectionPhoto from './SectionPhoto.astro';
---
<section class="visit-guide section" aria-labelledby="visit-guide-title">
  <div class="visit-guide__heading reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Plan your manicure</p>
    <h2 id="visit-guide-title">Your shape. Your colour.<br /><em>Your starting point.</em></h2>
    <p>Choose what you know and leave the rest for a conversation with Bianca. You can request an appointment without a finished design in mind.</p>
    <SectionPhoto photo="neutral" caption="A softer finish to start your inspiration board." aspect="wide" />
  </div>
  <div class="visit-guide__items">
    <article class="reveal"><span>01 / Shape &amp; length</span><h3>Choose your natural length.</h3><p>Choose a length that fits your everyday routine. Short length is included in a new structured gel manicure; medium and long have add-ons. <a href="/services-pricing#length">See the nail length and shape guide.</a></p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><span>02 / Colour &amp; detail</span><h3>Save your favourite designs.</h3><p>Choose solid colour or an art tier. You can upload reference images or paste Pinterest links in your appointment request. <a href="/services-pricing#art">Compare nail art tiers.</a></p></article>
    <article class="reveal"><span>03 / Your starting point</span><h3>Tell us about existing gel.</h3><p>Have an overlay, old extensions or a broken nail? Bianca may suggest a fill, removal or repair. <a href="/services-pricing#fills">Explore maintenance options.</a></p></article>
  </div>
</section>
